{"code":"PK20","wikidata":"Q123537780","wikipedia":{"en":"Maiyalap MRT station","th":"สถานีมัยลาภ"},"summary":{"en":"Maiyalap station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Ram Inthra Road, near Soi Ram Inthra 14 (Soi Maiyalap) in Bang Khen district, Bangkok. The station has four exits.","th":"สถานีมัยลาภ เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนรามอินทราในพื้นที่เขตบางเขน กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-2.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-3.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-3.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-4.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Maiyalap_Station_20231203-4.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC